for example  the number of visits to local air  politics via mobile or via tablet is up  you know by 20 fold over the last couple  of years and that's something that you  know people aren't just coming to  sitting down at their computers and  dialing up the website right they are  they're getting it on their phones  they're getting it on their iPads and  and that's a challenge for us you know  not only from a content production  standpoint and transferring what we do  what we have always done our business  into this new you know these new  platforms but also sort of as a business  proposition from an advertising  standpoint Tom thanks so much for  talking to us crazy TV and Tracy  Oppenheimer  you
 

